<title>USA: Epitope names corporate controller.</title>
<headline>Epitope names corporate controller.</headline>
<dateline>BEAVERTON, Ore. 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Epitope Inc said on Monday it has appointed Mark Allred to the newly created position of corporate controller.</p>
<p>Allred joins Epitope from the accounting firm of Deloitte &amp; Touche LLP. In his new position Allred will act as principal accounting officer of the company supervising all accounting and finance functions.</p>
<p>Shares of Epitope were 5/8 lower at 11-5/8 on the American Stock Exchange.</p>
